{"id": "housing-voucher-administrator-contract-ceilings", "title": "Two clauses put different ceilings on a housing voucher contract", "seconds": 45.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "e3422b915f5fb360", "words": 130, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "This is an investigative lead about a voucher contract extension.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.43, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Board resolution", "$46.4 million"], ["Contract-value clause", "$42.4 million"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.32, 0.44, 1.19, 1.45, 1.69, 1.77, 2.17, 2.67]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The resolution named a $46.4 million ceiling.", "t0": 3.55, "t1": 6.84, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$46.4 million", "label": "What the board authorized"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.8, 1.04, 1.13, 1.69, 1.97, 2.25, 2.6, 2.9]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Four commissioners voted yes.", "t0": 6.96, "t1": 8.45, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "resolution", "kicker": "What the board authorized", "text": "Four commissioners", "mark": "Four"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.77, 1.08]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The amendment starts with that same ceiling.", "t0": 8.67, "t1": 10.72, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "amend", "kicker": "Two ceilings on the same page", "text": "Third amendment", "mark": "Third"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.6, 0.94, 1.1, 1.3, 1.61]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Then the contract-value clause says $42.4 million.", "t0": 10.84, "t1": 14.65, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$42.4 million", "label": "Two ceilings on the same page"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.33, 1.15, 1.53, 1.82, 2.43, 2.74, 3.03, 3.37]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The figures are four million dollars apart on the same page.", "t0": 14.77, "t1": 17.55, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Same page"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 0.59, 0.85, 1.17, 1.51, 1.85, 1.94, 2.06, 2.35]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The annual amounts provide an independent check.", "t0": 17.67, "t1": 19.95, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "amend", "kicker": "The annual amounts reconcile", "text": "Annual amounts", "mark": "Annual"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.48, 0.84, 1.19, 1.33, 1.97]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The extension covers 2026 and 2027. The last two years add $20.7 million.", "t0": 20.07, "t1": 26.53, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["2026", "$10 million"], ["2027", "$10.7 million"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.64, 0.99, 1.32, 1.97, 2.08, 2.39, 3.57, 3.76, 4.02, 4.25, 4.54, 4.74, 5.08, 5.37, 5.69, 6.03]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "All six entries add to the higher ceiling.", "t0": 26.65, "t1": 28.59, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Annual amounts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.51, 0.85, 1.02, 1.12, 1.24, 1.53]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The table also carries the other administrator’s contract number.", "t0": 28.81, "t1": 31.93, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "amend", "kicker": "A second contract number appears in the table", "text": "Contract number", "mark": "Contract"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.52, 0.88, 1.25, 1.38, 1.61, 2.28, 2.79]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "That separate agreement has a $42 million ceiling.", "t0": 32.05, "t1": 34.96, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["CVR heading", "22-002-1"], ["CVR table", "22-002-2"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.56, 1.01, 1.21, 1.3, 1.85, 2.17, 2.5]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The posted CVR amendment has blank signature lines.", "t0": 35.08, "t1": 37.95, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "amend", "kicker": "A second contract number appears in the table", "text": "Signature lines", "mark": "Signature"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.49, 1.06, 1.52, 1.72, 2.02, 2.46]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The signed contract and purchasing ledger could settle which limit governed.", "t0": 38.07, "t1": 41.58, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Purchasing ledger"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.47, 0.99, 1.12, 1.62, 1.98, 2.18, 2.51, 2.78, 3.09]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 41.7, "t1": 44.05, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.38, 0.5, 0.58, 1.3, 1.53, 1.63]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "What the board authorized", "b": "Two ceilings on the same page", "o": "A second contract number appears in the table"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}